# Criteria section 7: every declaration is checked as written, used or
# not. From bootstrap/examples/decl-tag-unresolved.moss:
#
# DeclsForm (AUDIT-CHANGES #76; criteria section 7): a tag's payload
# denotes a type as written, used or not; `Nope` is not in scope.
# Verdicts: oracle accepts; native accepts; Audit before accepts (nothing
# reads the payload); now rejects (TyOf). Class B.
#
# The verdicts above predate the self-hosted compiler's check: it now
# rejects this too. The oracle still accepts it (a gap in agreement.rs).
tag Box(Nope);
fn main() {}
